description	"GenoHaradan Enforcer

Elite Assassins Equipped in a Mesh Combat Suit with integrated Vambrance Weaponry.

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Grapple Hop
- Blast Armor
- Beskar (1)
- Slow Faller
- Knockdown Roll
- Tracking Beacon

^3Abilities:
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]"